 down  uh but um  his his his resume otherwise is not an  inspiration to me at any rate and uh  but i i do understand that secession and  slavery were not the same  were not the same causes for many men  they had no choice but to but to choose  uh to  fight andy thank you so much on behalf  of the southern festival of books we're  so glad you came to nashville and uh to  reiterate andy will be in the signing  colonnade immediately after this thank  you thank you very much  thank you very much  andrew ward is author of river run red  it's published by viking adult an  imprint of the penguin group for more  information visit penguin.com
 

